Text: With skeletal data, an ASL sign can be seen as a sequence of 3D coordinates or a 3D time series [6]. Recurrent neural networks (RNN) have shown strong performance for sequen- tial modeling [7]. In this work, we investigate the impact of RGB video data in recognition accuracy when combined with skeletal data. We also propose a combined RNN network with a simple spatial data augmentation technique.

Rank: 6
